flowchart TB
accTitle: Physical diversity and global gateway reach
accDescr: Two location-diverse Direct Connect paths reach a shared Direct Connect gateway, which associates with regional virtual private gateways.
DC[Data center]:::inputData
DC --> R1[Router A + DX location A]
DC --> R2[Router B + DX location B]
R1 -->|private VIF A| DXG[Direct Connect gateway]
R2 -->|private VIF B| DXG
DXG --> VGW1[VGW in us-east-1]
DXG --> VGW2[VGW in us-west-1]
VGW1 --> V1[VPC east]:::output
VGW2 --> V2[VPC west]:::output
